  "review": [
    "No chorus. Two 8-line stanzas; the whole hymn is a chain of questions to Christ. ذنب المعيب → חַטָּאת הַמְּגוּנָה (settled rendering of مُعيب, cf. h0030) per glossary. \"عاري المذيب\" rendered \"בֹּשְׁתִּי הַמַּתִּיכָה\" (my dissolving shame). 2:5 keeps the emphatic \"أنا\" (אֲנִי)."
  ]
